# Android Architecture

- Flow: Screen → ViewModel → Repository → Data (Room / DataStore)
- Feature ViewModels MUST extend `BaseViewModel`
- Feature repositories MUST extend `BaseRepository`
- UI state via `UiState<T>` exposed as `StateFlow`
- Never call DAO or Repository from Composables
- Never call DAO from ViewModel directly — go through Repository
- One-shot operations return `AppResult<T>`; streams return `Flow`

See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/ADDING_FEATURE.md`.
